'''Neko-Musume''' (ねこ娘, ''Cat Girl'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

