|money drop = 1,000円 - 3,950円
}}

==Enemy==
Neko-Musume is a quick and weak enemy that only appears in the Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event.  Her rapid attacks with the addition of knockback and Area Attacks can provide a hinderance if not constantly meatshielding,

==Strategy==
Due to her somewhat low range, units such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], their crazed variants, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and more can deal with her at a safe range. However [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher-class Cats]] can also deal with her since every knockback can help reposition the unit without being attacked by the support in her stages.

